Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.21,0:00:05.06,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now raise your hands up! Sing your dreams out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.14,0:00:08.71,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always stand up! Raise our unyielding flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.78,0:00:12.26,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,So many obstacles are already behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.32,0:00:17.68,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's keep moving forward! Hands up!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.30,0:00:30.64,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,"I'm almost there, just a little further and I'll have the answer."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.13,0:00:27.39,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(58,558)}Translation\N{\fs40}bobthemilkman @ Yibis Fansubs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.55,0:00:30.64,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(790,366)}Translation check\N{\fs40}Lord Starfish @ Yibis Fansubs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.73,0:00:38.37,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,That's what I believed as I sailed into this new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.11,0:00:34.25,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(80,424)}Initial timing\N{\fs40}FAbian101 @ Yibis Fansubs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.80,0:00:38.38,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(808,486)}Timing\N{\fs40}Galaxy 9000
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.45,0:00:45.86,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,That's right, the pieces of our dreams are joined together as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.33,0:00:43.61,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(190,296)}Quality checking\N{\fs40}Sewil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.61,0:00:45.87,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(180,488)}Soundtracking\N{\fs40}MaideV and Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.95,0:00:53.90,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,We're connected by unwavering bonds, let's head for a bright future!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.95,0:00:48.13,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(844,384)}Raw providing\N{\fs40}OPC-Raws
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.52,0:00:52.98,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\an5}Editing\N{\fs40}Sewil
