Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.41,0:01:05.74,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,So many obstacles are already behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.86,0:01:09.78,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's keep moving forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.87,0:01:11.28,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always look up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.38,0:01:13.47,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep your head held high!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.51,0:01:14.94,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always step up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.00,0:01:16.81,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Fly over the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.89,0:01:20.40,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Our dreams have been carefully joined together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.43,0:01:24.65,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's head for the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.90,0:01:31.04,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,We drift forward, riding the waves,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.07,0:01:35.27,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,meeting people and saying goodbye, then doing it again,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.33,0:01:39.51,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,all under this flag...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.28,0:01:44.63,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Pain I don't want to forget is kept in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.72,0:01:48.18,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,There was a day when I softly carved it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.27,0:01:51.79,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,I won't let anyone take my freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.84,0:01:54.73,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,I grasp it tightly in my hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.79,0:01:59.67,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now raise your hands up! Sing your dreams out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.76,0:02:03.35,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always stand up! Raise our unyielding flag.
