Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.67,0:02:10.82,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's keep moving forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.90,0:02:12.18,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always look up!
