Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.91,0:02:17.70,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Fly over the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.74,0:02:21.43,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Our dreams have been carefully joined together.
